From 361c379dd08a86eb324c8733e25caa2962060a32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jon West <electrikjesus@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:11:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Taskbar: Add the tablet system bar layout

With persist.retro.ui_layout=system_bar and three-button navigation the
taskbar becomes a tablet system bar: back, home and recents (plus optional
volume, screenshot and sleep buttons) at the start, and a tray at the end
with notification icons, network, battery, volume and the clock. Tapping
the tray opens the notification or quick settings panel on this display.
persist.retro.ui_style=kitkat draws the KitKat look and hides the app icons.

Needs the frameworks/base ISystemUiProxy per-display panel toggles.

Change-Id: Ic6565db4f92aaf71293dd5f1c2eaf5e4524ce0c1
